### note: Source-derived Ergon Showcase two-phase domain command evaluation reference (localhost:8080), not deployed on the public Quickstart host. Evaluates homologar-designacoes-lote against explicit target versions and vacancy availability without mutating domain rows.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@sessionCookie = replace-with-ERGONSESSION-cookie-value
@xsrfToken = replace-with-XSRF-TOKEN-cookie-value
@orgao = 2

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ergon/designacoes/bulk/homologar-designacoes-lote/evaluation
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: ERGONSESSION={{sessionCookie}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrfToken}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrfToken}}
X-Tenant: {{orgao}}

< ../../payloads/hr/ergon_chefia_designacoes_homologar_lote_evaluation.json
